##grflangid 0x01

STR_GRF_NAME :China Fictional Maglev Set
STR_GRF_DESC :Fictional Chinese maglev vehicles: TR08, TR2012, TR2015 and MR2015 with multiple livery schemes. Runs on maglev track.
STR_GRF_URL :https://github.com/Alexei124r/OpenTTD-China-Fictional-Maglev-Set
STR_PARAM_CAPACITY :Passenger capacity
STR_PARAM_CAPACITY_DESC :Multiplier for passenger capacity. Default 100%.
STR_PARAM_PURCHASE :Purchase cost
STR_PARAM_PURCHASE_DESC :Multiplier for purchase cost. Default 100%.
STR_PARAM_RUNNING :Running cost
STR_PARAM_RUNNING_DESC :Multiplier for running cost. Default 100%.
STR_PARAM_MAIL_CAPACITY :Mail capacity
STR_PARAM_MAIL_CAPACITY_DESC :Mail capacity multiplier for all mail-capable vehicles.
STR_PARAM_LOADING_RATE :Loading speed
STR_PARAM_LOADING_RATE_DESC :Loading and unloading speed multiplier for all vehicles.
STR_PARAM_CARGO_AGE :Cargo age period
STR_PARAM_CARGO_AGE_DESC :Cargo age period multiplier for all vehicles.
STR_PARAM_MAIL_X05 :x0.5
STR_PARAM_MAIL_X1 :x1
STR_PARAM_MAIL_X2 :x2
STR_PARAM_MAIL_X4 :x4
STR_PARAM_X1 :x1
STR_PARAM_X2 :x2
STR_PARAM_X4 :x4
STR_ERROR_CONSIST :Invalid maglev consist: at most two regular head cars, at most two MR2015 when mixed, and at least one intermediate car between two heads.
STR_NAME_TR08_HEAD :Transrapid 08 Head Car
STR_NAME_TR08_HEAD_FIRST :Transrapid 08 Head Car (First Class)
STR_NAME_TR08_HEAD_SECOND :Transrapid 08 Head Car (Second Class)
STR_NAME_TR2012_HEAD :Transrapid 2012 Head Car
STR_NAME_MID :Maglev Intermediate Car
STR_NAME_MID_FIRST :First Class Intermediate Car
STR_NAME_MID_SECOND :Second Class Intermediate Car
STR_DESC_TR08 :Maglev, 430 km/h. Can attach first-class and second-class intermediate cars. Refit selects livery.
STR_DESC_TR2012 :Maglev, 350 km/h. Can attach second-class intermediate cars. Refit selects livery.
STR_DESC_MID :Refit for type, class and livery. Power and capacity are set by the leading head car.
STR_NAME_MAGLEV_TRANSRANGER_2015 :TR2015 TransRanger Engineering Car
STR_DESC_MAGLEV_TRANSRANGER_2015 :Maglev engineering and towing car. 160 km/h alone; mixed passenger consists are limited to 100 km/h.
STR_DESC_MAGLEV_TRANSRANGER_2015_SIMPLE :Maglev engineering and towing car, 160 km/h. Static compatibility version without consist-dependent limits.
STR_NAME_MR2015 :Maglevranger 2015 (MR2015) Engineering Car
STR_DESC_MR2015 :Maglev engineering and towing car. 160 km/h alone; mixed passenger consists are limited to 100 km/h.
STR_NAME_TR2015_HEAD :Transrapid 2015 Passenger Head Car
STR_DESC_TR2015_HEAD :Maglev passenger head car, 450 km/h. Can attach first-class, second-class and baggage/second-class composite cars; a dining car is reserved. Refit selects livery.
STR_NAME_TR2015_FREIGHT_HEAD :Transrapid 2015 Freight Head Car
STR_DESC_TR2015_FREIGHT_HEAD :Maglev freight head car, 450 km/h. Can attach freight and refrigerated cars.
STR_NAME_TR2015_FREIGHT_MID :TR2015 Freight Car
STR_DESC_TR2015_FREIGHT_MID :Maglev freight car. Requires a TR2015 freight head car for traction.
STR_NAME_TR2015_REFRIGERATED :TR2015 Refrigerated Car
STR_DESC_TR2015_REFRIGERATED :Maglev refrigerated freight car. Requires a TR2015 freight head car for traction.
STR_NAME_TR2015_ZEXL :TR2015 Baggage/Second-Class Composite Car
STR_DESC_TR2015_ZEXL :Combined mail and passenger car. Currently may only be attached behind the TR2015 passenger head car.
STR_NAME_TR2015_ZEXL_PASSENGER :TR2015 Composite Passenger Section
